        + Cx * D * (C W.a₁ * X + C W.a₃))
      = E ^ 2 * (A₀ ^ 3 + C W'.a₂ * A₀ ^ 2 * B₀ + C W'.a₄ * A₀ * B₀ ^ 2 + C W'.a₆ * B₀ ^ 3) := by
